  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Fuente de los datos",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Tráfico:** sensor en Perdigon, conectado al **puerto espejo del switch**, que copia el **puerto del router** (4 → 2). Eso da el tráfico a internet de los equipos **cableados** (tele, PC y cualquier cosa enchufada al switch).\n\nLos equipos **Wi-Fi** no aparecen aquí: su tráfico no pasa por el puerto del router en el switch. De ellos sólo se ve el DNS, si usan AdGuard.\n\n**DNS y dispositivos:** AdGuard Home (`dns-map`)."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Consultas DNS",
      "description": "Consultas registradas por AdGuard (externo + interno + bloqueado).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(netviz_queries_total{kind=~\"external|internal|blocked\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Bloqueadas",
      "description": "Porcentaje bloqueado por las listas de AdGuard.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * sum(netviz_queries_total{kind=\"blocked\"}) / clamp_min(sum(netviz_queries_total{kind=~\"external|internal|blocked\"}), 1)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 30
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
